gVz(){return"\u2022 Recent delivery at Curotec (The Philadelphia Inquirer): native Audio Stories, Avo feed analytics, and Baseline Profiles for startup performance\n\u2022 Founder / Tech Lead at Probox Studio with a desktop KMP + AI product, observability, and cross-platform CI/CD\n\u2022 Refactored a banking NDK SDK from ~50MB to ~6MB while preserving features\n\u2022 Built OCR/liveness framework that cut manual document rejection by ~96%\n\u2022 Author of Jetpack Compose & SwiftUI for those who already know Flutter (2026)"},
