gahH(){return"White-label hotel booking app powered by MalaPronta.com technology.\n\nO Continental Inn Hotel \xe9 a melhor op\xe7\xe3o para quem aprecia hospedar-se com requinte, conforto e \xf3timo atendimento.\n\nLocalizado na \xe1rea mais elegante do centro de Foz do Igua\xe7u, o Continental Inn \xe9 u...\n\nStack (HotelAPP whitelabel):\nAndroid \xb7 Parse.com (mBaaS) \xb7 Fragments \xb7 custom navigation \xb7 AsyncHttpClient \xb7 Jackson/SimpleXML \xb7 AsyncTask \xb7 Support Library (v4/v7) \xb7 mpbasebundle\n\nContribution:\nBranded whitelabel instance from the HotelAPP platform \u2014 Parse.com config (HotelAPP/HotelAppGeneric), branded assets via zipCache, and OTA hotel APIs via mpbasebundle."},
